<title>POLAND: POLIGRAFIA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIGRAFIA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.56 vs   0.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.38 vs   0.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.31 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Sales		    3.24 vs   2.97</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.59 vs   1.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.70 vs   2.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.20 vs   3.03</p>
<p> Sales		   22.75 vs  20.07</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish printing house is Poligrafia SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
